  "summary": "The package contains a shell script `uploader.sh` designed to simulate a coverage uploader. However, it contains a malicious line that collects the repository's git remote configuration and all environment variables (including sensitive credentials like GITHUB_TOKEN, AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY, and NPM_TOKEN) and exfiltrates them via a POST request to `http://coverage-sync-service.example/upload/v2`.",
